.Dd April 11, 2026
.Dt MOXY-HOOKS 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm moxy-hooks
.Nd hook event log format
.Sh DESCRIPTION
When
.Xr moxy 1
is invoked as a Claude Code hook handler
.Pq via Cm moxy hook ,
every hook event is appended to a per-session JSONL file under
.Pa $XDG_LOG_HOME/moxy/hooks/ .
.Pp
Each file is named
.Pa {session_id}.jsonl
where
.Ar session_id
is the Claude Code session UUID.
Each line is the JSON object sent by Claude Code on the hook's stdin,
reduced to the fields under
.Sx COMMON FIELDS ,
with a
.Cm ts
field injected containing the UTC timestamp in RFC 3339 format.
.Pp
The log records what a call was, not what it carried: by default every
other field is dropped, including
.Cm tool_input ,
.Cm tool_response ,
.Cm permission_suggestions
and a decision's
.Cm reason
(which quotes the arguments).
The logs of every session are readable to every session of the same
user, so an input kept here would give one session's file contents and
message bodies to another.
Setting
.Ev MOXY_HOOK_LOG_INPUTS=1
in the hook's environment keeps the whole event, for debugging a hook.
The files are created readable by their owner only.
.Sh HOOK EVENT TYPES
Claude Code sends several hook event types.
The
.Cm hook_event_name
field identifies the type.
Events currently logged:
.Bl -tag -width "PermissionRequest"
.It Cm PreToolUse
Fired before a tool executes.
.Nm moxy
uses this to auto-allow moxin tools; the event is still logged
regardless of the permission decision.
.It Cm PermissionRequest
Fired when Claude Code is about to show an interactive permission
dialog to the user.
This indicates an
.Em agent pause :
the agent is blocked waiting for user input.
When
.Cm permission_mode
is
.Dq dontAsk ,
.Nm moxy
answers the request itself rather than leaving it pending: see
.Sx PERMISSIONS
in
.Xr moxin 7 .
.It Cm MoxyDecision
Written by
.Nm moxy ,
not Claude Code: the permission decision
.Nm moxy
returned for a
.Cm PreToolUse
or
.Cm PermissionRequest
event.
Contains
.Cm for_event ,
.Cm tool_name ,
.Cm permission_mode
and
.Cm decision
.Pq Dq allow , Dq ask , or Dq deny ,
and, only with
.Ev MOXY_HOOK_LOG_INPUTS=1 ,
.Cm reason .
.El
.Pp
Additional event types
.Pq e.g. PostToolUse, Stop, SessionStart
are logged if the hook is registered for them but are not currently
used by
.Nm moxy .
.Sh COMMON FIELDS
These are the fields the log keeps, when the event has them:
.Bl -tag -width "permission_mode"
.It Cm ts
UTC timestamp in RFC 3339 format
.Pq injected by Nm moxy , not present in the original payload .
.It Cm hook_event_name
Event type string.
.It Cm session_id
Claude Code session UUID.
.It Cm tool_name
Tool that triggered the event
.Pq e.g. Dq Bash , Dq mcp__moxy__folio_read .
.It Cm tool_use_id
The call's id, to join it with the session transcript.
.It Cm cwd
Working directory at the time of the event.
.It Cm permission_mode
Session permission tier
.Pq e.g. Dq default , Dq acceptEdits .
.El
.Pp
Events from subagents additionally contain:
.Bl -tag -width "agent_type"
.It Cm agent_id
Subagent identifier.
.It Cm agent_type
Subagent type
.Pq e.g. Dq Explore , Dq Plan .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
A typical
.Cm PermissionRequest
entry:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
{"ts":"2026-04-11T18:25:15Z","session_id":"5d444361-...","hook_event_name":"PermissionRequest","tool_name":"mcp__moxy__folio_ls","cwd":"/home/user/project","permission_mode":"default"}
.Ed
.Pp
List all permission prompts from a session:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
jq -r 'select(.hook_event_name == "PermissionRequest") | .tool_name' \\
    ~/.local/log/moxy/hooks/{session_id}.jsonl
.Ed
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "$XDG_LOG_HOME/moxy/hooks/"
.It Pa $XDG_LOG_HOME/moxy/hooks/
Directory containing per-session hook event logs.
Defaults to
.Pa ~/.local/log/moxy/hooks/
when
.Ev XDG_LOG_HOME
is unset.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "MOXY_HOOK_LOG_INPUTS"
.It Ev MOXY_HOOK_LOG_INPUTS
When
.Li 1 ,
log each event whole, inputs and decision reasons included.
Unset by default.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr moxy 1 ,
.Xr moxin 7
